<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Green's Food year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Green's Food year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 1.69 vs 1.49</p>
<p>    Net profit			 0.85 vs 1.23</p>
<p>    Sales			    133.02 vs 122.57</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	 0.5  vs 0.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Green's Foods Ltd is a producer and distributor of cooking ingredients, mixes, pet foods and dressings.</p>
<p>-- Sydney neswsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
